      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Neat idea, but also not everyone runs VRChat on a dedicated setup. Some people use VRChat on laptops for the PC version of VRChat. You also have to account for the Quest version of VRChat, which is a more strict tri count.\nI think the count is fine where it's at.",
